{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Last Term is a spot the difference horror game. Trapped in a school, each floor appears the same. But is it? Look out for any anomalies to determine if it's different than the last. Progress to floor 0 to uncover how you ended up here.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The final bell has already rung, but something won\u2019t let go...</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3722600/extras/96cae549ac4b713578148e57c2d47185.avif?t=1757383542\" width=800 height=75 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3722600/extras/2ccd3dcacc4be0c749827f843656bf86.poster.avif?t=1757383542\" width=800 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3722600/extras/2ccd3dcacc4be0c749827f843656bf86.webm?t=1757383542\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Navigate through the school and familiarize yourself with the surroundings. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>There's 3 areas the game revolves around:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hallway</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Classroom</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Bathroom</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3722600/extras/c1f2305df5ffdb16527004efb3666ca3.avif?t=1757383542\" width=800 height=75 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3722600/extras/32a57f9de9ca3c1a45f4e818e8d8ed53.poster.avif?t=1757383542\" width=800 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3722600/extras/32a57f9de9ca3c1a45f4e818e8d8ed53.webm?t=1757383542\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3722600/extras/32a57f9de9ca3c1a45f4e818e8d8ed53.mp4?t=1757383542\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Uncover a variety of anomalies. Some  are subtle, others far more disturbing.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Certain anomalies are interactable, leading to unexpected moments</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3722600/extras/9ef74e5e1d63aec229ad107a66f22a5a.avif?t=1757383542\" width=800 height=300 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you spot any anomalies, go downstairs</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If everything feels normal, head upstairs</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Making the right decisions will put you closer to reaching floor 0.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3722600/extras/b09ca69b60bb87d060498113113e24b0.avif?t=1757383542\" width=800 height=75 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3722600/extras/34a67203d2794b8264e541ae9b9a4ca3.avif?t=1757383542\" width=800 height=300 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The anomaly book allows you to track which anomalies you have encountered and work towards spotting them all!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3722600/extras/79bc27c8242d60643a00976bcc184b22.avif?t=1757383542\" width=800 height=75 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over 50 unique anomalies</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3 endings</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Full English voiceover</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >30-60 minutes playtime</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3722600?t=1757383542","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3722600?t=1757383542","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3722600/66b4aed3c28c2fee14d010740b48806d056b4937/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1757383542","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3722600/66b4aed3c28c2fee14d010740b48806d056b4937/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1757383542","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Adjustable Text Size","id":64},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Subtitle Options","id":65},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"This game may contain content not appropriate for all ages, or may not be appropriate for viewing at work: General Mature Content"},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Last Term is a spot the difference horror game. Trapp